      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that it's biased, but sometimes for the boards they ask about historical medical perspectives or common clinical misconceptions we need to be aware of. like, can u talk about the historical context of why those ideas about racial differences in pain or even certain disease tendencies became so prevalent in medical literature? it's hard to know which outdated concepts are still floating around in academic settings.",
